case ok-command-echo-ack
desc two actions over the add-on channel and their acknowledgements
module yes
send addon action follow
frame addon PARTY TBM action follow
recv addon WHISPER TBM TBM:ACTION_ACK|follow|party|3|-
recv addon WHISPER TBM TBM:ACTION_ACK|attack|bot:Alpha|1|Alpha
expect ack.count 2
expect ack.0.intent follow
expect ack.0.scope party
expect ack.0.count 3
expect ack.0.detail -
expect ack.1.scope bot:Alpha
expect ack.1.detail Alpha
expect problems.count 0
